<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank sets tender for 10 bln Dmk of bills.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank sets tender for 10 bln Dmk of bills.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank said on Tuesday it was setting a tender for 10 billion marks of 6-month bubills.</p>
<p>Bids for the tender are due by 0900 GMT on Wednesday July 16, the Bundesbank said. The pay date if July 18.</p>
<p>The bubills, due January 16, 1998, are of the WKN 111 423 series.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
